  "description": "The new Cross Lite EVO Carbon combines performance and lightness for an outstanding riding experience. Whether you're on sporty tours over varied terrain or your daily commute, the latest generation of the Bosch Performance Line CX drive system, integrated into the sophisticated carbon frame, plays to its strengths. The result: maximum support combined with the best possible handling. Equipped with the 800 Wh PowerTube battery, this powerful e-trekking bike makes no compromises when it comes to energy reserves and offers maximum range for all your e-bike adventures. Fully equipped with an integrated brake light, MonkeyLoad luggage rack and mudguards, the Cross Lite EVO Carbon is universally applicable and ensures a first-class e-bike riding experience wherever you go.",
